{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3942750/extras/7fe6a0b0849791368cc73cc14503f413.poster.avif?t=1758646888\" aria-hidden=\"true\"width=800 height=228 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3942750/extras/7fe6a0b0849791368cc73cc14503f413.webm?t=1758646888\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3942750/extras/7fe6a0b0849791368cc73cc14503f413.mp4?t=1758646888\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wishfarers is a turn-based, tactical RPG with streamlined platformer movement, explosive combat, and destructible terrain.\u00a0</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wishing season is finally here, and the wishfarers are ready to get granting!\u00a0 Join a plucky band of adventurers as they chase shooting stars, face mysterious foes, fulfill wishes both big and silly, and find a decent pair of socks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3942750/extras/d6694b7955dba9124cb1c98b7c67ab33.poster.avif?t=1758646888\" aria-hidden=\"true\"width=800 height=332 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3942750/extras/d6694b7955dba9124cb1c98b7c67ab33.webm?t=1758646888\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3942750/extras/d6694b7955dba9124cb1c98b7c67ab33.mp4?t=1758646888\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Play explosive RPG battles with destructible environments.\u00a0</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players and enemies wield an arsenal of magical abilities to use in battle: Classic fireballs and lightning bolts, helpful healing spells, buffing bard songs, otherworldly summons, astral armaments, and the pinnacle of spell slinging\u2014Miracle Moves.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3942750/extras/6896d9256322ee1b3e03604a091692a9.poster.avif?t=1758646888\" aria-hidden=\"true\"width=800 height=332 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3942750/extras/6896d9256322ee1b3e03604a091692a9.webm?t=1758646888\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3942750/extras/6896d9256322ee1b3e03604a091692a9.mp4?t=1758646888\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Challenge bosses across the Archmages' Archipelago.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Wishfarers will battle many magnificent bosses in their star-studded quest, including the storm guardians of Mt. Plumeria, the champion of the Sasquatch Superdome, an ancient psychic gem turtle, and more!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3942750/extras/501859810967bdbc595719cb6f010317.poster.avif?t=1758646888\" aria-hidden=\"true\"width=800 height=332 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3942750/extras/501859810967bdbc595719cb6f010317.webm?t=1758646888\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3942750/extras/501859810967bdbc595719cb6f010317.mp4?t=1758646888\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Jump into turn-based, tactical combat streamlined with platformer movement.\u00a0</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players move primarily by running and jumping about the map via simple platformer controls.\u00a0 Additionally, characters can learn magical movement abilities such as explosive leap, kunai dash, and wind walk.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3942750/extras/c6c0476bc38df2c49439daf65b0f96af.poster.avif?t=1758646888\" aria-hidden=\"true\"width=800 height=332 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3942750/extras/c6c0476bc38df2c49439daf65b0f96af.webm?t=1758646888\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3942750/extras/c6c0476bc38df2c49439daf65b0f96af.mp4?t=1758646888\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customize characters with 7 classes, over 100 abilities, and a multitude of magical socks.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the Wishfarers improve their combat prowess, players can customize each party member with a secondary suite of spells, magical movements, enchantments, and counterspells.\u00a0 Characters can be further outfitted with magic gloves, boots, and up to two special socks!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3942750/extras/77c9af970d1f34858b48a1555720a073.poster.avif?t=1758646888\" aria-hidden=\"true\"width=780 height=324 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3942750/extras/77c9af970d1f34858b48a1555720a073.webm?t=1758646888\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3942750/extras/77c9af970d1f34858b48a1555720a073.mp4?t=1758646888\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore a whimsical world of falling stars and lost wishes.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world of wishfarers is a wild and magical place where wizard duels break out at the drop of a sock.\u00a0 Rowdy monsters roam the land looking for fights.\u00a0 The Zodiac guild is collecting wishes to sell to the highest bidder.\u00a0 The Plumerians are in political turmoil.\u00a0 The Sasquatches will scrap as a means of saying hello.\u00a0 And there\u2019s a rumor that the Scion of Stars will grant any wish in exchange for a star\u2014even if it is not your own.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3942750?t=1758646888","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3942750/ffb947afcc3fc5e74bd8846afab1c07edc331b67/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1758646888","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3942750/3aa5911ecfd4d09f3c4eeb52246e88cb3e5c69fa/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758646888","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3942750/3aa5911ecfd4d09f3c4eeb52246e88cb3e5c69fa/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758646888","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3942750/extras/7fe6a0b0849791368cc73cc14503f413.poster.avif?t=1758646888\" aria-hidden=\"true\"width=800 height=228 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3942750/extras/7fe6a0b0849791368cc73cc14503f413.webm?t=1758646888\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3942750/extras/7fe6a0b0849791368cc73cc14503f413.mp4?t=1758646888\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wishfarers is a turn-based, tactical RPG with streamlined platformer movement, explosive combat, and destructible terrain.\u00a0</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wishing season is finally here, and the wishfarers are ready to get granting!\u00a0 Join a plucky band of adventurers as they chase shooting stars, face mysterious foes, fulfill wishes both big and silly, and find a decent pair of socks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3942750/extras/d6694b7955dba9124cb1c98b7c67ab33.poster.avif?t=1758646888\" aria-hidden=\"true\"width=800 height=332 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3942750/extras/d6694b7955dba9124cb1c98b7c67ab33.webm?t=1758646888\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3942750/extras/d6694b7955dba9124cb1c98b7c67ab33.mp4?t=1758646888\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Play explosive RPG battles with destructible environments.\u00a0</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players and enemies wield an arsenal of magical abilities to use in battle: Classic fireballs and lightning bolts, helpful healing spells, buffing bard songs, otherworldly summons, astral armaments, and the pinnacle of spell slinging\u2014Miracle Moves.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3942750/extras/6896d9256322ee1b3e03604a091692a9.poster.avif?t=1758646888\" aria-hidden=\"true\"width=800 height=332 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3942750/extras/6896d9256322ee1b3e03604a091692a9.webm?t=1758646888\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3942750/extras/6896d9256322ee1b3e03604a091692a9.mp4?t=1758646888\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Challenge bosses across the Archmages' Archipelago.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Wishfarers will battle many magnificent bosses in their star-studded quest, including the storm guardians of Mt. Plumeria, the champion of the Sasquatch Superdome, an ancient psychic gem turtle, and more!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3942750/extras/501859810967bdbc595719cb6f010317.poster.avif?t=1758646888\" aria-hidden=\"true\"width=800 height=332 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3942750/extras/501859810967bdbc595719cb6f010317.webm?t=1758646888\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3942750/extras/501859810967bdbc595719cb6f010317.mp4?t=1758646888\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Jump into turn-based, tactical combat streamlined with platformer movement.\u00a0</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players move primarily b