as/77c9af970d1f34858b48a1555720a073.mp4?t=1758646888\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore a whimsical world of falling stars and lost wishes.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world of wishfarers is a wild and magical place where wizard duels break out at the drop of a sock.\u00a0 Rowdy monsters roam the land looking for fights.\u00a0 The Zodiac guild is collecting wishes to sell to the highest bidder.\u00a0 The Plumerians are in political turmoil.\u00a0 The Sasquatches will scrap as a means of saying hello.\u00a0 And there\u2019s a rumor that the Scion of Stars will grant any wish in exchange for a star\u2014even if it is not your own.</p>","developers":["Squiddershins"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3942750/f917dc5a06088926436cb337ba3043b2d3b0f100/header.jpg?t=1758646888","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Mac OSX 10.12 or later<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3 or equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Intel HD Graphics</li></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3942750/1228199925/5a04fb2fadc7fdff3e9716d370e38058e95026c2/1758262482/dash_av1.mpd?t=1758646885","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3942750/1228199925/5a04fb2fadc7fdff3e9716d370e38058e95026c2/1758262482/dash_h264.mpd?t=1758646885","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3942750/1228199925/5a04fb2fadc7fdff3e9716d370e38058e95026c2/1758262482/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1758646885","id":257201853,"mp4":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257201853/movie480.mp4?t=1758646885","